This is a boilerplate project that tries to codify architecture and best-practices using static typing and code generation.

All results of code generation should live in a subdirectory of the architecture layer: `src/{layer}/generated`.

The primary code generation command is `npm run codegen`.

When handlers need to do multiple write actions to the database (using the prisma client), the operation must be wrapped in a transaction.